  "solution": {
    "text": "Photochemical smog consists of nitrogen oxides, volatile organic compounds, tropospheric ozone, etc.,&nbsp;<math><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>l</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , a chlorofluorocarbon, is not present in photochemical smog, but is a major cause of ozone-layer depletion."
